    "11.f.W: resolve embedded normalized queries and basic project views through the existing query engine; assert ordered typed rows, independent column projection, exact query totals/pagination, configuration filtering, unchanged source/revision/hash bindings, no 100-row view cap, explicit empty policy, literal width/types/copy rejection and Core/PYZ parity.",
